OL,3,GNEWSAMayor to meet airport bosses about
OL,4,Aparkway station
OL,5,
OL,6,FWest Yorkshire Mayor Tracy Brabin is to
OL,7,Fmeet Leeds Bradford Airport bosses
OL,8,Fabout a proposed parkway station.
OL,10,FCouncillors from West Yorkshire have
OL,11,Fvoted to move ahead with plans for a
OL,12,Frailway station that would serve the
OL,13,Fairport, with the leader of Bradford
OL,14,FCouncil saying he was "delighted" to
OL,15,Fsupport the scheme.
OL,17,FWest Yorkshire Combined Authority
OL,18,F(WYCA) was given an update on the plans
OL,19,Fat a meeting on Thursday, with Brabin
OL,20,Fsaying she was "determined" to make
OL,21,Fsure the proposed station was finally
OL,22,Fapproved.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
