OL,3,GNEWSAMayor to meet airport bosses about
OL,4,Aparkway station
OL,5,
OL,6,FBrabin also said she would speak to
OL,7,Fairport bosses at an event in the
OL,8,Fcoming days, where they would "set out
OL,9,Fthe vision to get this delivered".
